ist 5 subcommands\n  - If `mise run lint` flags anything you couldn't fix\n  - If you needed to deviate from the plan\n- Self-review notes","agentId":"a6178c0443cadf8bb","agentType":"dev","content":[{"type":"text","text":"---\n\n## Status: DONE\n\n**New commit SHA:** `a81101fab`\n\n**Files created:**\n- `/cmd/entire/cli/agent/antigravity/hooks.go` — `InstallHooks`, `UninstallHooks`, `AreHooksInstalled` with `.agents/hooks.json` read/write, idempotency check, foreign-key preservation\n- `/cmd/entire/cli/agent/antigravity/hooks_test.go` — 5 tests (no `t.Parallel()` due to `t.Chdir`)\n- `/cmd/entire/cli/agent/antigravity/lifecycle.go` — `HookNames`, `ParseHookEvent` with all 5 event mappings and `extractFilesFromToolCall`\n- `/cmd/entire/cli/agent/antigravity/lifecycle_test.go` — 8 lifecycle tests (all `t.Parallel()`)\n\n**Files modified:**\n- `antigravity.go` — stub block removed; unused `io` import removed\n- `hooks_cmd.go` — added `_ \"github.com/entireio/cli/cmd/entire/cli/agent/antigravity\"` before `claudecode`\n- `committed_reader_resolve.go` — restored `//nolint:ireturn` (Chunk 1 regression)\n- `manual_commit.go` — restored `//nolint:ireturn` (Chunk 1 regression)\n\n**Test delta:** 5308 → 5323 (+15 tests: 5 installer + 8 lifecycle + 2 extra lifecycle coverage tests)\n\n**Smoke test:** All 5 subcommands (`pre-tool-use`, `post-tool-use`, `pre-invocation`, `post-invocation`, `stop`) respond correctly under `entire hooks antigravity <verb> --help`. They're hidden commands, so `--help` on the parent doesn't list them — this is consistent with other agents (verified by comparison with `hooks claude-code`).\n\n**Deviations from the plan:**\n\n1. **No `testutil.InitRepo` in `hooks_test.go`** — The architecture test (`TestAgentPackages_NoForbiddenImports`) prohibits agent packages from importing `cli/testutil`. Geminicli's hooks tests use only `t.TempDir() + t.Chdir()`, relying on the `os.Getwd()` fallback in `InstallHooks`. I followed the same pattern.\n\n2. **Idempote