{"parentUuid":"1e467e01-dab8-49ed-a0be-46d93fa3046f","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-7","id":"msg_016AGRiD9Aaiy44bW1ez5KM5","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Clean. The double-encoded args fix is in.\n\n`★ Insight ─────────────────────────────────────`\n- **Three real bugs caught by smoke testing** that the integration tests missed entirely: (1) PostInvocation transcript-not-found, (2) banner mechanism doesn't work in agy 1.0.0, (3) agy double-encodes tool args. None would have surfaced without running the actual binary.\n- Pattern: every agent integration needs a real-binary smoke pass after the unit/integration tests. The integration tests pre-stage clean docs-shape payloads; the real agent sends messier payloads. The gap between \"docs say\" and \"binary does\" is where production bugs live.\n- The defensive `decodeAgyString`/`decodeAgyBool` helpers tolerate BOTH the docs format AND agy's actual format. If agy fixes the double-encoding in a future version, our code keeps working without modification.\n`─────────────────────────────────────────────────`\n\nNow retry agy with a fresh prompt to verify the full pipeline produces a checkpoint:\n\n```fish\ncd /tmp/agy-smoke\n\n# Clean stale state (the diag-conv leftover)\n$ENTIRE clean    # or just remove the stale session file\nrm -f .git/entire-sessions/diag-conv.json\n\n# Fresh agy turn\nagy\n> create a file called test.txt with the text \"smoke test pass\"\n# (Ctrl-D or exit after agy completes)\n\n# Verify session state captured files_touched this time\nls -t .git/entire-sessions/ | head -3\ncat .git/entire-sessions/<newest>.json | jq '.session_id, .files_touched, .phase'\n\n# Commit and check checkpoint\ngit add test.txt && git commit -m \"third agy smoke\"\ngit log -1 --format=\"%B\"            # should show Entire-Checkpoint trailer\n$ENTIRE checkpoint list              # should show ≥ 1\n$ENTIRE status\n```\n\nThe key expectations now:\n- `.files_touched` in the session state JSON should contain `test.txt` (or whatever file agy creates)\n- `git log -1` should show an `Entire-Checkpoint: <hex>` trailer\n- `checkpoint list` should show a count ≥ 1\n- `status` should show the just-completed antigravity session\n\nIf any of those four still fail, the bug is downstream of file capture and we'll need to dig further. But this fix addresses the most likely root cause (silent unmarshal failure on agy's weird arg encoding)."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":279,"cache_read_input_tokens":797909,"output_tokens":837,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":279,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":837,"cache_read_input_tokens":797909,"cache_creation_input_tokens":279,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":279},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CbG7KdavV3nnY47tRBjc7","type":"assistant","uuid":"9be1a83b-378e-42db-acfa-11d224f56e59","timestamp":"2026-05-21T17:29:40.048Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/peytonmontei/Documents/entire/devenv/entireio/cli","sessionId":"27c10fbd-3055-4d96-8e88-8a95ee2d9e1e","version":"2.1.145","gitBranch":"feat/antigravity-agent"}
